x #114199\r\n~There is currently a flaw: due to the continuous invocation of `set_oversampling_override` during the scaling process, lag occurs when the zoom level is too high. Perhaps it could be changed to call `set_oversampling_override` only when scaling stops?~ Completed.\r\n\r\n~I have temporarily set the oversampling update interval to 0.5 seconds, and perhaps it can later be exposed as an editor setting.  \r\nConsidering that excessively high zoom levels may still cause lag when updating oversampling, perhaps this feature itself could also have an editor toggle.~ Completed.\r\n\r\nAdded a `Auto Resample CanvasItems` checkbox in the `View` menu, which is checked by default and will be persisted to the project metadata.  \r\nAdded `editors/2d/auto_resample_delay` in the editor settings, with a default value of 0.3 seconds.\r\n\r\nBefore: \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe072db9-edb4-4f0a-8542-5153b5afd937\r\n\r\nAfter: \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9dbf893c-3195-4751-9d4b-9ad35ab0752c\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"re